{
  "_readme": [
    "Optional Coolapk credentials for the reply/comment fetch. Copy to auth.json (NOT tracked by git).",
    "",
    "ANDROID (guest) knobs - may still hit Coolapk's NetEase NIS captcha on the reply list:",
    "  device       - replaces the built-in per-install device fingerprint.",
    "  login_token  - account token from a logged-in Coolapk session; sent as ?token= (plus uid).",
    "  uid          - account uid that goes with login_token.",
    "",
    "iOS PASSTHROUGH - the only profile known to pass the captcha guarding the reply list",
    "(confirmed by Yorushika-fan/coolapk-web and the stack behind coolapk1s.com).",
    "Capture once from the official Coolapk iOS app with Charles/mitmproxy: open a post, find the",
    "request to /v6/feed/detail, copy its headers. Used for replies only, tried first.",
    "  ios_token    - X-App-Token from that request",
    "  ios_device   - X-App-Device from that request",
    "  ios_cookie   - the full Cookie header (optional but recommended)",
    "  ios_ua       - optional User-Agent override",
    "  ios_upstream - optional, default https://api.coolapk.com",
    "Refresh when comments start failing again - that token is short-lived.",
    "",
    "Any key may be omitted; the file is re-read at most once a minute, no restart needed."
  ],
  "device": "",
  "login_token": "",
  "uid": "",
  "ios_token": "",
  "ios_device": "",
  "ios_cookie": "",
  "ios_ua": "",
  "ios_upstream": ""
}
